# Admin Console rules

Read before editing `src/Admin/`:

- Onboarding: `docs/admin/ONBOARDING.md`
- Add/extend features: `docs/admin/EXTENSIBILITY_GUIDE.md`
- Shared helpers: `docs/admin/COMMON_LIBRARIES.md`
- Full AI checklist: `docs/admin/LLM_FEATURE_IMPLEMENTATION_RULES.md`

## Architecture

- `features/*` = pages/screens only; may import `shared/*`, `i18n/*`, `config/*`
- `shared/*` must NOT import from `features/*`
- API: extend `shared/api/admin-api.ts` + types in `shared/types/api.ts`; use `apiRequest` from `client.ts`
- Routes: `app/router.tsx`; nav: `AdminLayout` `navItems`

## i18n (required for new UI)

- Use `useTranslation()` and `t('key')` for all user-visible strings
- Add keys to `i18n/locales/en.json`, `vi.json`, and `zh.json` together
- Zod messages: `createLoginSchemas(t)`, `createUserFormSchemas(t)`, or `createValidators(t)`

## Reuse shared lib — do not reinvent

```ts
import { formatDateOrDash, formatDateTimeOrDash, formatEmpty, toast, toastApiError, runAdminAction, confirmAction, copyWithToast } from '@/shared/lib'
import { queryKeys } from '@/shared/constants/query-keys'
import { formSelectClass } from '@/shared/constants/styles'
```

- Dates: never `toLocaleDateString()` in feature pages
- Pagination: `usePagination`, `useTotalPages`, `DataTablePagination`
- Search: `useDebouncedValue`
- Mutations: invalidate `queryKeys.*`; `idempotent: true` on admin writes; pass `rowVersion` when required

## Page shell

```tsx
<PageHeader title={t('...')} description={t('...')} />
<PageContent>...</PageContent>
```

## Quality

- Minimal diff; match existing Tailwind + Card/Button patterns
- Run `npx tsc -b` in `src/Admin` after changes
- Update `docs/admin/FEATURE_CATALOG.md` when adding user-facing features
- No secrets in code; no refresh token in localStorage
